{title: Intezaari}
{artist: Armaan Malik Ayushman Khurana}
{key: Em}

{c: Verse 1}
[Em]Aana aabhi [D]jaana,        [C]Intezari hai [D]teri
[Em]Leja jo [D]rishto ki,        [C]Raizgaari hai [D]teri
Wo jo hum [Am]roye saath [D]the,        Bheege din [Am]or raat [D]the
Khaare-khaare [C]paani ki,        [D]Kahaani wo leja [G]na [B]aa
[Em]Aana, aabhi [D]jaana,        [C]Intezaari hai [D]teri
[Em]Leja, jo [D]rishto ki,        [C]Rezgaari hai [D]teri
Danti [Em]kaate sung baate-khatte,        [D]Meethe ka maja hai
Jubaan [C]pe abb bhi taaza [Em]saathiya,        Chaand [Em]dekha tha jo hum ne
Char [D]aankhon se kbhi,        Kaise [C]dekhu usko tanhaa [Em]saathiya
Danti [Em]kaate sung baate-khatte,        [D]Meethe ka maja hai
Jubaan [C]pe abb bhi taaza [Em]saathiya,        Chaand [Em]dekha tha jo hum ne
Char [D]aankhon se kbhi,        Kaise [C]dekhu usko tanhaa [Em]saathiya
Ho [Em]kabhi yuhi [D]taakna tujhe,        [A]Yuhi [Em]dekhna
[Em]Kbhi baithe [D]baithe yuhi,        [A]Tujhe [Em]sochna
Woh [Am]pal karaar [D]ke,        Woh jo the [Am]lamhein pyar [D]ke
Unhe mere [C]khwaabon se,        [D]khayaalo se le [G]jaana [B]aa
[Em]Aana, aabhi [D]jaana,        [C]Intezari hai [D]teri
[Em]Leja, jo [D]rishto ki,        [C]Rezgaari hai [D]teri
[Em]Kabhi ruthna [D]wo tera,        [A]Kisi baat [Em]pe
[Em]Kabhi haske [D]taali dena,        [A]Mere hath [Em]pe
Thode [Am]shikwein kuch [D]gile,        Woh jo the [Am]apne [D]silsille
Tootey hue [C]waade wo,        [D]Iraade wo lee [G]jaana [B]
[Em]Aana, abhi [D]jaana,        [C]Intezaari hai [D]teri
